\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u>입금 </u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><u>&nbsp;신입생,편입생은 수험번호 및 이름으로 입금</u></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><u><strong></strong></u>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;7. 교통카드 발급 안내 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">후원금을 입금한 영수증과 교통카드 보증금(10,000원)을 지참하여 학생회관</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1층 학사서비스센터에서 교통카드를 발급 받아 통학버스 이용.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #696969; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(교통카드 보증금 10,000원은 버스를 이용후(학기 말) 학사서비스센터에 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 카드를 반납하면&nbsp;즉시&nbsp;환불 조치)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #696969; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HSty